## Sovereign Source Declaration

This software is released as **Sovereign Source** - code that respects user
autonomy, privacy, and freedom. It embodies the following principles:

- **User Sovereignty**: You control your data, your AI, your environment
- **Privacy First**: All AI inference can run locally in your browser
- **No Vendor Lock-in**: Switch between WebLLM, OpenRouter, or Ollama freely
- **Transparent**: Open source, auditable, no hidden telemetry
- **Accessible**: Runs entirely in the browser, no server required

By using this software, you affirm your right to sovereign computing.